description:
[                    
                    {
                        "text":"Degilmagna is a Fire Elemental Dragon. <br>Be careful because it has a high critical rate <br>and gives massive critical damage.",
                        "expression":"250"
                    },
                    {
                        "text":"Having a high critical resistance <br>or being able to paralyze <br>or freeze it is the key to victory.",
                        "expression":"240"
                    }
]

[                    
                    {
                        "text":"Palamicia is a Water Elemental God. <br>It'll be easier to give her damage <br>when she's paralyzed.",
                        "expression":"250"
                    },
                    {
                        "text":"Units with attacks that paralyze or reduce <br>her paralyze resistance are the key to victory!",
                        "expression":"250"
                    }
]

[                    
                    {
                        "text":"Tonetaurus is an Earth Elemental Beast. <br>It's difficult to give damage to it during <br>Storm mode.",
                        "expression":"210"
                    },
                    {
                        "text":"You'll definitely need to increase your <br>Accuracy rate. <br>You can cancel Storm mode by breaking, <br>so use attacks with high Break power.",
                        "expression":"250"
                    }
]

[                    
                    {
                        "text":"Oldeus is a Dark Elemental Demon. <br>It's difficult to give Physical damage, <br>so don't forget to use Magic attacks.",
                        "expression":"240"
                    },
                    {
                        "text":"When you are cursed, you won't be able <br>to use equipment, so you'll need to prepare <br>for that.",
                        "expression":"210"
                    }
]

[                    
                    {
                        "text":"Subject β-3 is a Non-Elemental Machine.",
                        "expression":"250"
                    },
                    {
                        "text":"It gives massive damage to Light and Dark <br>units, and it is hard to damage with Fire, <br>Water, and Earth Elements.",
                        "expression":"250"
                    },
                    {
                        "text":"Be careful of its Throw Attack! <br>Don't forget to bring damage resistance <br>equipment, too!",
                        "expression":"210"
                    }
]

[                    
                    {
                        "text":"Fosradius is a Light Elemental Dragon.",
                        "expression":"250"
                    },
                    {
                        "text":"Arts won't deal much damage to it, <br>so rely on Skills and Equips instead.",
                        "expression":"220"
                    }
]

[                    
                    {
                        "text":"Ifrit is a Fire Element God. <br>Magic damage isn't very effective against him, <br>so focus on Physical attacks instead.",
                        "expression":"210"
                    },
                    {
                        "text":"He takes Critical damage while frozen, <br>but be careful <br>because that also increases reflected damage.",
                        "expression":"250"
                    }
]

[                    
                    {
                        "text":"Radachne is a Light Elemental God. <br>Be prepared to deal <br>with her powerful CRI strikes.",
                        "expression":"210"
                    },
                    {
                        "text":"However, your own CRI attacks <br>won't be very effective. <br>Try DEF-ignoring ones instead.",
                        "expression":"250"
                    },
 {
                        "text":"Units take more damage <br>while they're covering allies, too!",
                        "expression":"250"
                    }

]

[                    
                    {
                        "text":"Raydis is an Earth Elemental Spirit.",
                        "expression":"210"
                    },
                    {
                        "text":"Her defense will drop while she's Burning.",
                        "expression":"200"
                    },
                    {
                        "text":"However, being Poisoned will turn her attacks<br>into Critical hits, so be careful.",
                        "expression":"250"
                    }
]

[                    
                    {
                        "text":"Code XTF: Eraser is a Machine <br>that periodically changes its Element.",
                        "expression":"250"
                    },
                    {
                        "text":"The kind of damage <br>you deal affects how it transforms.",
                        "expression":"240"
                    },
                    {
                        "text":"After a mode switch, <br>units in the matching Element <br>will take more damage <br>while their attacks will become ineffective.",
                        "expression":"210"
                    },
                    {
                        "text":"I recommend bringing a well-rounded party <br>to take it down faster.",
                        "expression":"200"
                    },
                    {
                        "text":"It also self-destructs when it runs out of HP, <br>and the energy leftover <br>from changing Elements determines <br>the blast force.",
                        "expression":"210"
                    },
                    {
                        "text":"If it only switches a few times, <br>that last explosion will be extremely powerful, <br>so watch out.",
                        "expression":"260"
                    }
]

[                    
                    {
                        "text":"Garm is a Fire Elemental Beast.",
                        "expression":"210"
                    },
                    {
                        "text":"You can dampen his blazing offense<br>for a short time <br>with a strong attack of your own.",
                        "expression":"200"
                    },
                    {
                        "text":"It might also be a good idea<br>to have Burn-relieving measures.",
                        "expression":"250"
                    }
]

[                    
                    {
                        "text":"Ugetsu is a Demon that will switch <br>between Dark and Fire Elements <br>whenever she uses Arts.",
                        "expression":"210"
                    },
                    {
                        "text":"Disease and Freeze will make it <br>easier to damage her.",
                        "expression":"200"
                    },
                    {
                        "text":"Be sure to prepare <br>a party focused on that strategy.",
                        "expression":"240"
                    },
                    {
                        "text":"Her Critical hits will become much stronger <br>in the second half, <br>so don't relax until the end.",

                        "expression":"210"
                    }
]

[                    
                    {
                        "text":"Mohldora is an Earth Elemental Spirit.",
                        "expression":"200"
                    },
                    {
                        "text":"It'll summon minions, <br>and the more it has, <br>the stronger its attacks will be.",
                        "expression":"210"
                    },
                    {
                        "text":"Only Poison and Burn can damage the minions.",
                        "expression":"240"
                    },
                    {
                        "text":"Be sure to plan your party accordingly.",
                        "expression":"250"
                    },
                     {
                        "text":"Keeping their numbers as low as possible is key.",
                        "expression":"200"
                    }
]

[                    
                    {
                        "text":"Villakurz is a Dark Elemental Dragon. <br>He has nasty strikes that can inflict <br>Status Ailments like Poison and Blind.",
                        "expression":"210"
                    },
                    {
                        "text":"Blinded units will take extra damage, <br>so be sure to heal as soon as possible.",
                        "expression":"220"
                    },
                    {
                        "text":"On the other hand, being Poisoned makes <br>attacks against him more effective. <br>Maybe you can use that to your advantage.",
                        "expression":"200"
                    },
                    {
                        "text":"Watch out in the later half of the fight, <br>since his CRI rate will skyrocket.",
                        "expression":"210"
                    }
]

[                    
                    {
                        "text":"Freydal is a Water Elemental Beast.",
                        "expression":"200"
                    },
                    {
                        "text":"Water attacks won't even make it<br>bat an eye, so bring other units.",
                        "expression":"250"
                    },
                    {
                        "text":"It'll also constantly increase its Evasion <br>during battle.",
                        "expression":"210"
                    },
                    {
                        "text":"Counter that by boosting your Accuracy <br>or Burning away its buffs.",
                        "expression":"210"
                    },
                   {
                        "text":"It'll also annoy you with Freezing attacks,<br>so make sure to prepare for those, too.",
                        "expression":"250"
                    }
]

[                    
                    {
                        "text":"Elpneumas is an Earth Elemental Dragon. ",
                        "expression":"200"
                    },
                    {
                        "text":"Earth attacks won't do a thing, <br>so make sure your party has other units.",
                        "expression":"240"
                    },
                    {
                        "text":"Don't forget to prepare against its frequent <br>Paralyzing attacks, since the stun will last<br>longer the deeper into the Mines you go.",
                        "expression":"250"
                    },
                    {
                        "text":"But the scariest thing is <br>how it can Envenom you.",
                        "expression":"220"
                    },
                    {
                        "text":"While Envenomed, units take more and <br>more damage until they fall.",
                        "expression":"210"
                    },
                    {
                        "text":"On top of that, Poison-healing effects <br>won't work, and it doesn't go away <br>on its own.",
                        "expression":"220"
                    },
                   {
                        "text":"All you can do is keep recovering HP, <br>so slay it before it slays you.",
                        "expression":"200"
                    }
]

[                    
                    {
                        "text":"Wilkes is a Light Elemental Spirit.",
                        "expression":"240"
                    },
                    {
                        "text":"Humans can't hurt her much at all.<br>I suggest using other types.",
                        "expression":"250"
                    },
                    {
                        "text":"And make sure to bring units and Equips<br>that can inflict Blind, ",
                        "expression":"210"
                    },
                    {
                        "text":"Since that's the only way she can take<br>serious damage.",
                        "expression":"200"
                    },
                    {
                        "text":"She also likes to use an attack that<br>disables the Arts gauge auto-fill effect.",
                        "expression":"220"
                    },
                    {
                        "text":"You'll have more luck with instant boosts instead.",
                        "expression":"200"
                    },
                    {
                        "text":"Plus, watch out when her HP gets low. She'll<br>counter with a one-time Arts gauge reduction.",
                        "expression":"220"
                    },
                    {
                        "text":"Her attacks will become fiercer after that<br>as well, so respond likewise and finish the job<br>quickly.",
                        "expression":"210"
                    }
]

[                    
                    {
                        "text":"Geo Zagnus is a Water Elemental Giant.",
                        "expression":"200"
                    },
                    {
                        "text":"Humans, Gods, and Demons will take <br>more damage and hurt him less.",
                        "expression":"210"
                    },
                    {
                        "text":"I suggest bringing other types of units.",
                        "expression":"210"
                    },
                    {
                        "text":"Many of his attacks will also inflict <br>Poison, so be ready for that as well.",
                        "expression":"250"
                    },
                    {
                        "text":"Finally, his CRI rate will dramatically <br>increase when his HP gets low.",
                        "expression":"200"
                    },
                    {
                        "text":"Finish him off before he can do <br>the same to you!",
                        "expression":"260"
                    }

]

[                    
                    {
                        "text":"Phantom Ragsherum is a Dark Elemental Demon.",
                        "expression":"200"
                    },
                    {
                        "text":"He tears through shields. <br>I recommend a focus on DMG reduction and <br>HP recovery instead.",
                        "expression":"250"
                    },
                    {
                        "text":"His own defenses are tough until you Break him, <br>so make sure to have a Breaker unit.",
                        "expression":"210"
                    },
                    {
                        "text":"Poison will also take him down a notch <br>if you're still struggling.",
                        "expression":"250"
                    },
                    {
                        "text":"Be sure to keep an eye out for his <br>True Nightmare attack!",
                        "expression":"220"
                    },
                    {
                        "text":"He'll grab an ally with the highest HP and deal <br>fatal DMG! Don't let them go down easy!",
                        "expression":"210"
                    },
                    {
                        "text":"You can cancel it while he's charging with enough <br>Physical DMG. Just magic won't shake him.",
                        "expression":"250"
                    },
                    {
                        "text":"If you're successful, he'll Faint! <br>Take that chance to unleash a coup de grâce!",
                        "expression":"200"
                    }
]

[                    
                    {
                        "text":"Stiria is a Water Elemental Spirit.",
                        "expression":"200"
                    },
                    {
                        "text":"Each time your Break her, she will<br>take more damage.",
                        "expression":"240"
                    },
                    {
                        "text":"However, she won't take Break damage<br>at all without inflicting Burn or Disease.",
                        "expression":"250"
                    },
                    {
                        "text":"Since Fire DMG won't affect her, focus on<br>the Status Ailment than sheer power from Fire units.",
                        "expression":"200"
                    },
                    {
                        "text":"Frozen allies can't do much of anything...",
                        "expression":"220"
                    },
                    {
                        "text":"So watch out of her freezing and<br>Freeze resistance-lowering moves!",
                        "expression":"210"
                    },
                    {
                        "text":"When she's low on HP, she'll gain<br>CRI resistance as well.",
                        "expression":"240"
                    },
                    {
                        "text":"Make sure you have some other way<br>to mount an offense.",
                        "expression":"250"
                    },
                    {
                        "text":"It's a lot to remember, but experiencing<br>the fight for yourself is the best way to learn!",
                        "expression":"260"
                    }
]

[
    {
        "text":"Zwiber Z is a Water Elemental Machine.",
        "expression":"200"
    },
    {
        "text":"It resists CRI attacks, so bringing<br>units that ignore DEF might be wise.",
        "expression":"250"
    },
    {
        "text":"Being able to to shrug off its<br>Paralyzing strikes is also a must.",
        "expression":"210"
    },
    {
        "text":"Above all, watch out for its spear-like<br>weapon!",
        "expression":"220"
    },
    {
        "text":"It'll absorb DMG when driven into<br>the ground, so focus your offense on that.",
        "expression":"250"
    },
    {
        "text":"Destroying that will also slow it down,<br>giving you a golden opportunity!",
        "expression":"200"
    },
    {
        "text":"Send this metal monster to<br>the scrap heap!",
        "expression":"260"
    }
]

[
    {
        "text":"Marzex is a Light Elemental God.",
        "expression":"200"
    },
    {
        "text":"Neither Light nor Dark attacks will work on him, <br>so make sure your offense is based on other <br>Elements.",
        "expression":"240"
    },
    {
        "text":"You might want to bring some strong Breakers, too.",
        "expression":"250"
    },
    {
        "text":"Not only is he invincible until you Break him, <br>that can also interrupt his attack when he reaches <br>half HP.",
        "expression":"240"
    },
    {
        "text":"Also, be mindful of Burn, Poison, and Freeze.",
        "expression":"210"
    },
    {
        "text":"Since he takes more damage from low-HP allies...",
        "expression":"200"
    },
    {
        "text":"Maybe you can use Burn and Poison against him.",
        "expression":"200"
    },
    {
        "text":"Just get ready when he reaches low HP <br>since he becomes harder to hit.",
        "expression":"210"
    },
    {
        "text":"And never forget it isn't over until it's over...",
        "expression":"250"
    },
    {
        "text":"If you catch my drift.",
        "expression":"220"
    }
]

[                    
                    {
                        "text":"Palamicia Ω is a Water Elemental God.",
                        "expression":"210"
                    },
                    {
                        "text":"It'll be difficult to give damage unless <br>you paralyze her, so it's essential to <br>paralyze her.",
                        "expression":"210"
                    },
                    {
                        "text":"She seems to be very strong... <br>Please be careful...",
                        "expression":"230"
                    }
]

[                    
                    {
                        "text":"Oldeus Ω is a Dark Elemental Demon. <br>You can't give physical damage, so use <br>magical attacks!",
                        "expression":"210"
                    },
                    {
                        "text":"It'll inflict Instant Death attacks to units <br>who are cursed, so you'll need to prepare <br>for that.",
                        "expression":"210"
                    },
                    {
                        "text":"It's strong, but you can do it!",
                        "expression":"200"
                    }
]

[                    
                    {
                        "text":"Tonetaurus Ω is an Earth Element Beast. <br>It can only take DMG during Break, <br>so plan your team accordingly.",
                        "expression":"210"
                    },
                    {
                        "text":"Lowering its Break resistance <br>should help make your life a little easier.",
                        "expression":"250"
                    }
]

[                    
                    {
                        "text":"Ifrit Ω is a Fire Element God. <br>Use Physical attacks, <br>because Magic hardly hurts him at all!",
                        "expression":"210"
                    },
                    {
                        "text":"He can lower your Fire resistance, <br>so make sure you have ways <br>to keep your defenses up.",
                        "expression":"250"
                    }
]

[                    
                    {
                        "text":"Radachne Ω is a Light Elemental God. <br>Defanging her CRI strikes is essential.",
                        "expression":"210"
                    },
                    {
                        "text":"She has high DEF as well, <br>so better have attacks that ignore <br>as much of it as possible.",
                        "expression":"200"
                    },
{
                        "text":"Units covering allies will also take extra damage! <br>Use with caution!",
                        "expression":"250"
                    },
{
                        "text":"I know you can pull through!",
                        "expression":"260"
                    }
]

[                    
                    {
                        "text":"Raydis Ω is an Earth Elemental Spirit.",
                        "expression":"210"
                    },
                    {
                        "text":"An ounce of prevention is worth <br>much less than a pound of cure here!",
                        "expression":"200"
                    },
                    {
                        "text":"Bring units and Equips that can revive <br>since she'll unleash a powerful combination <br>of attacks at the start.",
                        "expression":"250"
                    },
                    {
                        "text":"Negating and shielding damage won't work<br>against her; focus on healing instead.",
                        "expression":"260"
                    }
]

[                    
                    {
                        "text":"Code XTF: Eraser Ω is a Machine <br>that periodically changes its Element.",
                        "expression":"250"
                    },
                    {
                        "text":"Though it's not much different <br>from the original version...",
                        "expression":"240"
                    },
                    {
                        "text":"The Elemental adaptations will last <br>through multiple changes.",
                        "expression":"210"
                    },
                    {
                        "text":"It'll be a tough fight, but with a balanced party, <br>careful control of its transformations...",
                        "expression":"210"
                    },
                    {
                        "text":"And Non-Elemental attacks <br>to deal consistent damage, <br>you can win.",
                        "expression":"200"
                    }
]

[                    
                    {
                        "text":"Garm Ω is a Fire Elemental Beast.",
                        "expression":"210"
                    },
                    {
                        "text":"It'll reduce your Burn Resistance <br>before lashing out with its flames.",
                        "expression":"250"
                    },
                    {
                        "text":"That's doubly dangerous as Burning units<br>will take Critical damage, <br>so make sure you're ready with an extinguisher.",
                        "expression":"220"
                    },
                    {
                        "text":"Especially strong attacks<br>will weaken it temporarily,",
                        "expression":"250"
                    },
                    {
                        "text":"but Resistance to that Element will be boosted<br>when it recovers.",
                        "expression":"210"
                    },
                    {
                        "text":"I suggest bringing a multi-Element party.",
                        "expression":"210"
                    }
]

[                    
                    {
                        "text":"Ugetsu Ω is a Demon that will switch <br>between Dark and Fire Elements <br>whenever she uses Arts.",
                        "expression":"210"
                    },
                    {
                        "text":"Her attacks absorb HP, <br>so a party that can quickly  <br>inflict Disease will reduce that advantage.",
                        "expression":"250"
                    },
                    {
                        "text":"That along with Freeze should <br>also make it easier to deal damage.",
                        "expression":"200"
                    },
                    {
                        "text":"Her Critical hits will become much stronger <br>in the second half, <br>so don't relax until the end.",
                        "expression":"210"
                    },
                    {
                        "text":"It'll be a tough fight, but hang in there!",
                        "expression":"260"
                    }
]

[                    
                    {
                        "text":"Mohldora Ω is an Earth Elemental Spirit.",
                        "expression":"200"
                    },
                    {
                        "text":"Watch out for the Ragveloth that are summoned <br>with the small Mohldoras.",
                        "expression":"210"
                    },
                    {
                        "text":"They'll get in the way of your attacks, <br>so don't ignore them!",
                        "expression":"220"
                    },
                    {
                        "text":"Unfortunately, they have high DEF.",
                        "expression":"250"
                    },
                    {
                        "text":"In addition to Poison and Burning damage <br>for the Mohldoras...",
                        "expression":"210"
                    },
                    {
                        "text":"Your party should ideally be able to do <br>lots of Critical hits.",
                        "expression":"200"
                    },
                    {
                        "text":"Try your best to break through the defenses!",
                        "expression":"260"
                    }
]

[                    
                    {
                        "text":"Villakurz Ω is a Dark Elemental Dragon <br>that can inflict many different Status Ailments.",
                        "expression":"210"
                    },
                    {
                        "text":"Blinded units will take CRI damage <br>from his attacks, so recovery measures <br>are a must.",
                        "expression":"200"
                    },
                    {
                        "text":"On the other hand, you can only hurt him <br>with Poisoned units. Keep your HP up<br>without curing the ailment itself.",
                        "expression":"250"
                    },
                    {
                        "text":"Also, be prepared to deal with Curse <br>and Disease on top of everything else.",
                        "expression":"220"
                    },
                    {
                        "text":"He's a tricky foe, but very much beatable. <br>Good luck!",
                        "expression":"260"
                    }
]

[                    
                    {
                        "text":"Subject Ω is a Non-elemental Machine.",
                        "expression":"250"
                    },
                    {
                        "text":"It might be wise to counteract its <br>Skill CT-slowing effect.",
                        "expression":"200"
                    },
                    {
                        "text":"It also has powerful Disease-inflicting attacks <br>that prevent you from recovering HP, <br>so I suggest preparing cures.",
                        "expression":"210"
                    },
                    {
                        "text":"Absolutely do not bring covering units. <br>The combined damage will be devastating.",
                        "expression":"220"
                    },
                    {
                        "text":"And stay alert for its fixed-damage attack! <br>If that catches you off-guard, <br>it'll wipe out the whole party.",
                        "expression":"210"
                    },
                   {
                        "text":"The battle won't be easy, <br>but I know you'll prevail!",
                        "expression":"260"
                    }
]

[                    
                    {
                        "text":"Freydal Ω is a Water Elemental Beast.",
                        "expression":"200"
                    },
                    {
                        "text":"It shares all of the same qualities <br>as the original Freydal.",
                        "expression":"240"
                    },
                    {
                        "text":"Immunity to Water, likes to Freeze your units, <br>and boosted Evasion that can be <br>cancelled by Burning.",
                        "expression":"240"
                    },
                    {
                        "text":"Now, you also have to be careful <br>how you set up your defenses.",
                        "expression":"240"
                    },
                    {
                        "text":"Shielding units will take extra punishment, <br>so use skills that negate DMG <br>individually.",
                        "expression":"220"
                    },
                   {
                        "text":"And bring recovery for those vicious blows <br>that can't be absorbed!",
                        "expression":"210"
                    }
]

[                    
                    {
                        "text":"Elpneumas Ω is a Earth Elemental Dragon.",
                        "expression":"200"
                    },
                    {
                        "text":"Just like the regular Elpneumas, <br>it's immune to Earth attacks and <br>will use Paralysis-inflicting attacks.",
                        "expression":"240"
                    },
                    {
                        "text":"It also can Envenom your units, <br>which ramps up the damage until they drop.",
                        "expression":"250"
                    },
                    {
                        "text":"However, this one will use Envenom twice: <br>once early on, then again later.",
                        "expression":"210"
                    },
                    {
                        "text":"Conditions will grow punishing <br>by the second half of the fight, <br>so have a steady flow of recovery going <br>before then.",
                        "expression":"220"
                    },
                   {
                        "text":"It's a race against time, <br>but I know you'll come out ahead.",
                        "expression":"200"
                    }
]

[                    
                    {
                        "text":"Degilmagna Ω is a Fire Elemental Dragon.",
                        "expression":"200"
                    },
                    {
                        "text":"It takes more DMG with frequent Breaks...",
                        "expression":"250"
                    },
                    {
                        "text":"So prepare attacks with high Break Power.",
                        "expression":"200"
                    },
                    {
                        "text":"Its attacks will start to penetrate your barriers <br>when its HP is low, so be careful.",
                        "expression":"210"
                    },
                    {
                        "text":"Either hang on with DMG reduction and healing, <br>or finish it off with a huge burst of DMG.",
                        "expression":"250"
                    },
                    {
                        "text":"Practice proper fire safety, too!",
                        "expression":"220"
                    },
                    {
                        "text":"Smother any sign of flames <br>since its CRI Rate skyrockets while Burning!",
                        "expression":"210"
                    },
                    {
                        "text":"Oh, and Earth attacks <br>will combust before they can land, <br>so base your offense around other Elements.",
                        "expression":"220"
                    },
                    {
                        "text":"This is one demanding foe, <br>but stand strong and prove your courage.",
                        "expression":"260"
                    }
]

[                    
                    {
                        "text":"Wilkes Ω is a Light Elemental Spirit.",
                        "expression":"240"
                    },
                    {
                        "text":"Not only are her defenses strong against <br>Humans and when not Blinded, ",
                        "expression":"250"
                    },
                    {
                        "text":"But her Arts gauge auto-fill cancelling <br>effect has been upgraded to an Arts gauge<br>draining effect!",
                        "expression":"220"
                    },
                    {
                        "text":"On top of that, she can empty the whole party's<br>gauges when her HP gets low,",
                        "expression":"210"
                    },
                    {
                        "text":"So be very careful with your timing.",
                        "expression":"200"
                    },
                    {
                        "text":"She'll get even tougher once she's cornered,",
                        "expression":"210"
                    },
                    {
                        "text":"Including the ability to nullify CRI attacks.<br>Rely on DEF-cancelling techniques to finish<br>her off. ",
                        "expression":"240"
                    },
                    {
                        "text":"This fight takes a fair amount of planning, <br>but it's certainly winnable.",
                        "expression":"260"
                    }
]

[                    
                    {
                        "text":"Geo Zagnus Ω is a Water Elemental Giant.",
                        "expression":"200"
                    },
                    {
                        "text":"Humans, Gods, and Demons are still <br>at a disadvantage, and he still gets ",
                        "expression":"250"
                    },
                    {
                        "text":"a higher CRI rate at low HP.",
                        "expression":"250"
                    },
                    {
                        "text":"His Poison is also devastating if left ignored.",
                        "expression":"210"
                    },
                    {
                        "text":"He's strong enough to make <br>the normal Geo Zagnus look puny, ",
                        "expression":"200"
                    },
                    {
